  "description": "In the waning age of magic, sorcerers do not simply die. Instead, their remains are crafted into staffs to empower future generations. Tethys, the court sorcerer, has made peace with her fate: when she perishes, she will become the staff for the young prodigy, Enya. Yet the cruelest burden falls to Dima, the craftsman who has known and loved her all his life, for when her tide finally recedes, his hands will be the ones to fashion what is left of her. Will he find the strength to fulfill his duty, at the cost of his own shattered heart?\n\n_Source: Tappytoon_",
